<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="stars we chase"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Mia Taylor (CV: Shu Uchida)"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Eutopia / EMOTION / stars we chase [Shioriko Mifune Version] - EP"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPI102201006"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1822731824"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="176552149"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Zennmn"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><transliterations><transliteration><text for="L1">I used to look above at stars, and chase</text><text for="L2">Never had to doubt what I could take</text><text for="L3">Now I've found it's further than it seemed</text><text for="L4">The light gets smaller, my eyes to a closure</text><text for="L5">When did it happen? Turned away my face</text><text for="L6">When did it happen? Pain increasing</text><text for="L7">Shadow walk and dealing, truth inside revealing</text><text for="L8">Still, a part of me's seeking that feeling</text><text for="L9">Dreams in the sound I made for you</text><text for="L10">Go 'round, come returning through me</text><text for="L11">Where this light shines so bright, you showed</text><text for="L12">It's back and now</text><text for="L13">Take your hand out, we can reach</text><text for="L14">Always been there to be freed</text><text for="L15">It's getting loud, on to a scream</text><text for="L16">We're starting this brighter tomorrow</text><text for="L17">Try this</text><text for="L18">Every color shown, bright in the star</text><text for="L19">From here we can find</text><text for="L20">Letting us shine</text><text for="L21">Don't hide your brightness</text><text for="L22">Approval of someone to feel complete</text><text for="L23">Honesty was gone to say the least</text><text for="L24">Many things about us are the same</text><text for="L25">The distance for us is hard to decipher</text><text for="L26">Why did it happen? I've imagined your face</text><text for="L27">Thinking about this lonely feeling</text><text for="L28">Standing still exceeding, urge and drive increasing</text><text for="L29">I've gotta be by you and speaking</text><text for="L30">A little time has been taken</text><text for="L31">I find it was time we needed</text><text for="L32">When our minds are aligned, we know</text><text for="L33">That star's in view</text><text for="L34">Let's restart it, you and me</text><text for="L35">Walking on our new story</text><text for="L36">I feel your voice, my melodies</text><text for="L37">Don't worry when struggling to follow</text><text for="L38">Find this</text><text for="L39">Allow this</text><text for="L40">Take your hand out, we can reach</text><text for="L41">Always been there to be freed</text><text for="L42">It's getting loud, on to a scream</text><text for="L43">We're starting this brighter tomorrow</text><text for="L44">Try this</text><text for="L45">Every color shown, bright in the star</text><text for="L46">From here we can find</text><text for="L47">Letting us shine</text><text for="L48">Don't hide your brightness</text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>TeddyLoid</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">曾仰望天上的星辰 追逐它们</text><text for="L2">从不怀疑自己能够摘取什么</text><text for="L3">如今才明白它比想象中遥远</text><text for="L4">那光芒渐小 我的双眼也慢慢阖上</text><text for="L5">是从何时起 我别开了脸？</text><text for="L6">是从何时起 疼痛愈发强烈？</text><text for="L7">行走在阴影中 与一切周旋 心底的真实渐渐显露</text><text for="L8">可我心底仍有一处在追寻那份感觉</text><text for="L9">我为你谱出的乐声里藏着梦想</text><text for="L10">辗转一圈 又回到我心间</text><text for="L11">你让我看见那光芒照耀之处如此明亮</text><text for="L12">如今它又回来了</text><text for="L13">伸出你的手 我们便能够触及</text><text for="L14">它一直在那里 等待着释放</text><text for="L15">声音渐响 直至化作呐喊</text><text for="L16">我们正开启更加明亮的明天</text><text for="L17">试试看吧</text><text for="L18">万般色彩在星辰中闪耀</text><text for="L19">从这里我们能够找到</text><text for="L20">让我们闪耀的光芒</text><text for="L21">不要藏起你的光彩</text><text for="L22">渴求别人的认可 才觉得自己完整</text><text for="L23">至少可以说 真心早已不见</text><text for="L24">你我有许多相似之处</text><text for="L25">我们之间的距离却难以捉摸</text><text for="L26">为何会变成这样？我想象着你的面容</text><text for="L27">思索着这份孤独的滋味</text><text for="L28">停驻太久 渴望与冲动愈发强烈</text><text for="L29">我一定要来到你身边向你倾诉</text><text for="L30">我们花去了一些时间</text><text for="L31">才发现这正是我们需要的时间</text><text for="L32">当彼此心意相通 我们便会明白</text><text for="L33">那颗星已映入眼帘</text><text for="L34">你和我一起重新开始吧</text><text for="L35">携手走进崭新的故事</text><text for="L36">我感受着你的声音 我的旋律</text><text for="L37">即使追赶得吃力也不必担忧</text><text for="L38">去发现它</text><text for="L39">让它发生吧</text><text for="L40">伸出手来 我们就能触及</text><text for="L41">它始终在那里 等待被释放</text><text for="L42">声音愈发响亮 直到尽情呼喊</text><text for="L43">我们正迎来更加明亮的明天</text><text for="L44">就试一次吧</text><text for="L45">万千色彩在星辰中绽放光芒</text><text for="L46">从这里我们能够找到</text><text for="L47">让彼此闪耀的光芒</text><text for="L48">别再遮掩你的光彩</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:07.415"><div begin="0:00.918" end="3:07.415"><p begin="0:00.918" end="0:04.806" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:00.918" end="0:01.127">I</span> <span begin="0:01.127" end="0:01.457">used</span> <span begin="0:01.457" end="0:01.627">to</span> <span begin="0:01.627" end="0:01.942">look</span> <span begin="0:01.942" end="0:02.137">a</span><span begin="0:02.137" end="0:02.781">bove</span> <span begin="0:02.781" end="0:02.890">at</span> <span begin="0:02.890" end="0:03.577">stars,</span> <span begin="0:03.577" end="0:03.747">and</span> <span begin="0:03.747" end="0:04.806">chase</span></p><p begin="0:05.317" end="0:08.567" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent